  "description": "The all-new 2027 SR 350. A new generation of titanium road performance, engineered to make every mile unforgettable.\n\nRebuilt from the ground up for 2027, the SR 350 brings together responsive sport road geometry, purposeful tube shaping without sacrificing comfort, it delivers an engaging, confident ride that feels just as rewarding on spirited efforts as it does on those all-day adventures.\n\nEvery tube has a purpose. Our signature Helix twisted down tube adds exceptional frame stiffness and responsiveness, while flattened, gracefully swooped seat stays help deliver the compliance and comfort that make titanium so special. A completely new pentagonal top tube further enhances structural stiffness, creating a finely balanced frame that transfers power efficiently while keeping the ride smooth and composed.\n\nFully compatible with UDH dropouts and engineered around our latest frame-specific tube shaping, the 2027 SR 350 represents the next evolution of Lynskey road performance. It's more than a refreshed road frame. It's 40 years of titanium knowledge, craftsmanship, and innovation brought together in a completely new design.\n\nRide further. Push harder. Enjoy every mile. This is the new SR 350.\n\nPre-Orders starting now. Estimated Shipping Before Christmas.\n\nUnfortunately we are currently out of road forks for these frames. If you are in need of a road disc fork below are the specs that you will need and a few options you can check out.\n\nFork options:\n\nENVE Road Disc Fork",
